# Images and fonts are binary: git does not open them to diff or search them (`git log -G` over the history stays fast).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

# The agent kit in .claude/ and .specify/ is vendored tooling, not the product: GitHub leaves it out of the language bar.
.claude/** linguist-vendored
.specify/** linguist-vendored
